    <div class="iv"><div class="iv-n">Intervention 04</div><div class="iv-t">Mandatory Data Publication</div><div class="iv-d">PHQ annual conviction rates. Supreme Court trial compliance rates. NFDPL processing times. A single ministerial order mandating quarterly disclosure of 6 key metrics ends the data void at near-zero cost.</div><div class="iv-m">Cost: administrative &#8212; no new institution required</div></div>
