      <div class="dp-row"><div class="dp-label">BRAC / Agile (2022) · S-01</div><div class="dp-track"><div class="dp-dot" data-pct="50.3" style="background:var(--greenl)"></div></div><div class="dp-val" style="color:var(--muted2)">3.66% ↑</div></div>
