    <div class="warn reveal" data-claim-id="BD-INV-002-C001"><strong>Zero convictions in 2024.</strong> First 7 months 2024: 643 OCC visitors → 227 cases filed → 12 verdicts → 0 convictions. This is not aberration. It is the system functioning normally. Source: Daily Star, Nov 2, 2024 (S-55).</div>

