    <div class="amb" style="margin-bottom:1.2rem">PHQ (Police Headquarters) publishes annual totals only. Monthly disaggregation has never been published. The table below documents what is known, what can be estimated, and what the state has chosen not to measure. All annual figures are used as context; monthly-specific figures are CONFIRMED ABSENT where marked.</div>

